    "title": "Why the 76ers traded Jared McCain to the Thunder - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dorcas Onasa ,\n1 hours ago When the Philadelphia 76ers selected Jared McCain with the 16th overall pick in the 2024 NBA Draft, the expectation was that they had found a building block. What followed instead was a sequence of events that led to McCain suiting up for a playoff contender just not the one that drafted him. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
